        "comments": "The assembly dmNupPumi1.hap1.1 is based on 64x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial and plastid genomes were assembled using OATK. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size. The exact order and orientation of the contigs on chromosome 8 (13,379 ? 19,365 Kbp) are unknown. The exact order and orientation of the contigs on chromosome 10 (17,005 ? 26,218 & 61,457 ? 72,643 Kbp) are unknown.",
